window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This book is part of a series, blurb may contain spoilers.</p> <p></p> <p>A sacrifice that could risk it all…I finally free my bloodline of our endless curse, but in doing so, I lose a piece of my soul—and someone I love more than anything.</p> <p></p> <p>After giving up all hope, a shred of optimism floats into my life. Forcing my internal demons to the side, I follow every possible lead that comes my way.</p> <p></p> <p>With so many things going on around me, I must balance infinite impossible hurdles. How will I prioritize my needs and those of the people I love?</p> <p></p> <p>Worst of all, I continue to struggle with who to trust, especially when I’m unsure of…even myself.</p> <p></p> <p>A race against the clock is something I never anticipated, but now that time is my enemy, I must decide if I’ll take the blind leap into the unknown.</p> <p></p> <p>It’s not just my heart, but my life on the line, too.</p> <p></p> <p>Ancient Magic is the fourth installment in a new adult paranormal academy romance series full of heartache, fearless choices, and trusting your instincts.</p> <p></p> <p>NOW A COMPLETED 5-BOOK SERIES! Slow burn, steam increases with series.</p>"; 
